39
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:20,840
Webb's detectors are so sensitive that they capture more light than our eyes where screens

40
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,360
can process.

41
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:26,320
So we need to use certain techniques to bring out the faintest details and make them visible

