43
00:02:28,880 --> 00:02:32,160
Stretching and compression are one of the ways that we do this.

44
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:36,100
These techniques ensure we highlight the bulk of what was captured in the image.

45
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:40,440
We then refine each piece of data by removing any artifacts or anomalies that might be hiding

46
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:42,120
what's there.

